A Diploma or Degree in IT, Logistics, or Business Administration with at least 2 to 3 years' experience in assets management within the ICT environment. The candidate must have a good understanding of ICT best practices, ability to provide management reports and good accurate records keeping. ITIL foundation certification and an experience with IT Asset management software applications is an added advantage.
Closing Date: 21 November 2025.

