Ensures TMF’s clients are provided with an efficient, professional and high quality of service which meets all of their obligations, striving for flawless client service. Act as a primary point of conact for our external legal intermediaries ensuring timely and efficient delivery of services to clients.
Key Responsibilities
Act as primary point of contact with external legal intermediaries for all legal and regulatory matters;
