Drafting of corporate services agreements, supporting the Head of Transaction review in negotiating pressure points with transaction party counsel, and ensuring that all services are fully documented and obligations are clear;
Identify risks in relation to the Transactions, and ensure full compliance with local and European level regulatory requirements;
Keep up to date on regulatory changes impacting the Debt Capital Markets industry, with a keen eye on non-regulated and regulated funds services, and corporate matters.
