Work closely with other teams in TMF Group, including but not limited to, the Transactions Services team, the Entity Management team, the Client Accounting team and TMF nominated Directors of SPVs, in order to achieve flawless service;
Ensure TMF meets our obligations to clients, ensuring that all tasks required to effectively close the Transactions within required timelines are completed efficiently and professionally;
Provide exceptional customer service whilst being decisive, firm and empathetic with customers;
Support business development through following ‘Our Service Promise’ delivery guidelines for relationship management and work to build your own and TMF’s network in the industry where you will be dealing with lawyers, tax advisors, banks, custodians, investment managers and other key partners;
Identify and act on opportunities for cross-selling and up-selling of TMF Services, or billing for out of scope items, ensuring effective communication with the Services Team to capture additional fees;
